%% V02 Test Seq 05
%% Concrete DnD deferred lifecycle: Wall of Fire ring with end-turn tick and concentration break.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor CasterUI as WizardIria UI
  actor AffectedUI as BanditCaptain UI
  participant Transport as WS/REST Handler
  participant Service as ActionExecutionApplicationService
  participant Graph as OperationGraphStage
  participant Targets as TargetResolutionStage
  participant RollPolicy as Manual Roll Policy
  participant Effects as Effect and Zone Stage
  participant Conc as Concentration Stage
  participant Events as Event Publisher

  Note over CasterUI,Service: Encounter setup\nWizardIria spell DC 17, concentration active after cast\nWall of Fire tick damage 5d8 fire\nBanditCaptain HP 65 Dex modifier 2, ArcherBandit attacks caster later

  CasterUI->>Transport: execute_action(req-2401, spell.wall_of_fire_ring)
  Transport->>Service: execute_action(command)

  Service->>Graph: build graph from zone create to tick registration
  Graph-->>Service: deterministic order
  Service->>Targets: resolve initial area snapshot
  Targets-->>Service: snapshot persisted
  Service->>Effects: create deferred zone instance
  Effects-->>Service: zone_created
  Service->>Conc: start concentration ownership
  Conc-->>Service: concentration_started

  Service->>Events: emit cast-phase lifecycle batch
  Events-->>CasterUI: resolved req-2401
  Events-->>AffectedUI: visibility-filtered updates

  AffectedUI->>Transport: end_turn(req-2402)
  Transport->>Service: process end-turn trigger
  Service->>Effects: evaluate zone occupants and apply tick effects
  Service->>Effects: BanditCaptain Dex save d20 12, total 14 vs DC 17 fail
  Service->>RollPolicy: evaluate manual roll mode for Wall of Fire tick damage
  RollPolicy-->>Service: requires_pending_roll
  Service-->>Transport: ActionExecutionOutcome status pending_roll with roll_context formula 5d8 fire
  Transport-->>CasterUI: pending_roll prompt for tick damage entry
  CasterUI->>Transport: continue_action req-2402 submitted_roll total 21 dice 2 8 6 4 1
  Transport->>Service: resume_from_roll req-2402
  Service->>Effects: validate submitted roll bounds and apply tick damage total 21 fire
  Effects-->>Service: zone_tick_resolved and effect_tick_resolved, HP from 65 to 44

  Note over CasterUI,Service: Later in round ArcherBandit hits WizardIria for 13 piercing\nConcentration check DC is 10

  alt Concentration check fails due to damage
    Service->>Conc: roll Con save d20 5, total 7 vs DC 10 fail
    Service->>Conc: break_concentration with reason failed_check
    Conc-->>Service: concentration_broken and concentration_cleared
    Service->>Effects: remove linked zone/effects
    Effects-->>Service: zone_removed and effect_removed
  else Concentration maintained
    Service->>Conc: roll Con save at least 10
    Conc-->>Service: concentration persists, zone remains active
  end

  Service->>Events: emit end-turn tick and cleanup events in canonical order
  Events-->>CasterUI: tick/cleanup batch
  Events-->>AffectedUI: tick/cleanup batch

  Note over Service,Events: Assertions\n1. Tick damage is applied only after pending_roll submission and validation\n2. Failed save plus validated roll yields 21 fire and HP moves from 65 to 44\n3. Tick resolves before expiry and removal semantics\n4. Concentration failure path removes linked zone deterministically
